WEBVTT

00:14.790 --> 00:19.000
Representatives of the graduating students,
Liniana Dedoldia.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.380
And Pursena Adoldia.

00:24.090 --> 00:27.050
Step forward to receive your diplomas

00:27.050 --> 00:30.590
and your proof as D-rank members
of the Magic Guild.

01:51.130 --> 01:57.010
MUSHOKU TENSEI: JOBLESS REINCARNATION SEASON 3

01:59.470 --> 02:04.020
I was surprised to see both of you attend
Linia and Pursena's graduation ceremony.

02:04.020 --> 02:08.690
A lot has happened between us,
but they look up to you.

02:08.690 --> 02:13.780
In that case, I can't keep harboring
hostility toward them forever.

02:13.780 --> 02:18.280
To be honest, I barely interacted
with those crude beasts.

02:18.280 --> 02:20.160
But as fellow special students,

02:20.160 --> 02:22.710
I think of them as classmates
who studied hard alongside us.

02:23.250 --> 02:26.000
That's why I wanted to give them
a proper send-off.

02:27.290 --> 02:29.250
When I first enrolled,

02:29.250 --> 02:33.170
there was a kind of awkward tension
among the special students.

02:34.010 --> 02:36.010
But they've changed.

02:40.390 --> 02:42.270
Nanahoshi, I'm coming in.

02:42.270 --> 02:43.430
Come in.

02:46.730 --> 02:48.750
Did you catch a cold again?

02:49.520 --> 02:51.030
It seems so.

02:51.030 --> 02:55.740
For the last year, Nanahoshi had
been getting sick frequently.

02:55.740 --> 02:58.280
Whether it was a dry cough or a fever.

02:58.640 --> 03:02.160
I helped her with Detoxification
whenever it happened,

03:02.160 --> 03:04.910
but she got sick again right away.

03:04.910 --> 03:08.840
Detoxification can't help you
if your body isn't healthy, you know?

03:08.840 --> 03:12.510
At least rest your body until
you're completely recovered.

03:12.510 --> 03:14.760
The research is making progress right now,

03:14.760 --> 03:16.720
so I can't afford to rest.

03:16.720 --> 03:20.100
Her research is surely progressing.

03:20.100 --> 03:22.270
Now we are on phase three.

03:22.270 --> 03:27.480
We are able to summon a living thing,
like a plant or animal.

03:27.480 --> 03:31.230
I'm sure we can bring vegetables from
our original world into this world soon.

03:31.770 --> 03:33.230
Steady progress, indeed.

03:33.730 --> 03:36.200
Okay, let's begin the research.

03:37.780 --> 03:38.740
Come in.

03:42.050 --> 03:43.410
Purrdon me.

03:43.410 --> 03:44.760
I'm coming in.

03:44.760 --> 03:46.710
Boss, we've been looking for you, meow.

03:46.710 --> 03:48.960
We need to talk.

03:48.960 --> 03:51.960
Something seems a bit
different about them.

03:51.960 --> 03:53.460
Another duel, I guess?

03:53.960 --> 03:57.720
Maybe they're thinking, "We can't
return before we win!" like that?

03:57.720 --> 03:59.760
Boss, purrease.

03:59.760 --> 04:01.390
Come with us.

04:03.200 --> 04:06.810
Oh well, I'll accompany them
for the last time.

04:06.810 --> 04:08.230
Okay.

04:08.230 --> 04:10.350
Sorry, Nanahoshi.
I'll go with them for a bit.

04:10.350 --> 04:12.040
I made the reservation first here!

04:12.040 --> 04:13.480
What about our experiments then?

04:13.480 --> 04:15.070
You come too, meow.

04:15.070 --> 04:17.399
This is a special invitation.

04:17.399 --> 04:20.360
Yeah, we allowed it!
So be thankful, meow!

04:20.360 --> 04:24.130
W-Wait! I'm busy here!

04:31.420 --> 04:32.670
Let's do it here.

04:32.670 --> 04:34.630
This place really takes mew back.

04:35.010 --> 04:40.050
This is the place where Zanoba and I
kidnapped them some time ago.

04:40.890 --> 04:44.510
It was also the place where
I'd fought them for the first time,

04:44.510 --> 04:46.270
a place full of memories.

04:46.270 --> 04:50.940
Master, do they want to
ask for a rematch?

04:54.110 --> 04:56.030
Maybe so.

05:02.910 --> 05:05.700
We want Boss and all of you
to watch us, meow.

05:06.070 --> 05:07.410
What are you going to do?

05:07.410 --> 05:11.750
Linia and I are going to decide
which of us is stronger.

05:11.750 --> 05:13.580
But why?

05:13.580 --> 05:17.340
The one who wins will be the next
chief of the Doldia tribe, meow.

05:18.550 --> 05:22.220
Aren't the Dedoldia and Adoldia
two different tribes?

05:22.220 --> 05:25.100
Can't you be the chief
for your own tribe?

05:25.100 --> 05:28.180
We were purranning to do that at first.

05:28.180 --> 05:32.350
Until we blew every suitor during
our mating season, meow.

05:32.350 --> 05:37.020
In the end, there's no man who's
stronger than us among them.

05:37.020 --> 05:40.110
So we decided the strongest
among us will be the chief.

05:40.110 --> 05:42.490
The loser will live
the way she wants.

05:42.490 --> 05:45.200
There's more in this life
than being a chief.

05:45.200 --> 05:46.740
No hard feelings, meow.

05:46.740 --> 05:48.700
What kind of logic is that?

05:48.700 --> 05:50.160
Okay.

05:50.160 --> 05:53.290
Fight as much as you like.

05:53.290 --> 05:56.380
Are you sure you're going
to help them fight?

05:56.380 --> 05:59.260
Whether I'm watching or not,
they're going to fight anyway.

05:59.260 --> 06:00.970
We appurreciate it.

06:00.970 --> 06:02.430
Thanks.

06:04.160 --> 06:06.760
I think they are evenly matched.

06:07.240 --> 06:11.530
But just in case of them overdoing it,
someone needs to watch.

06:12.640 --> 06:16.650
I wasn't going to make a big deal,
but this is a duel, not a fight.

06:16.650 --> 06:19.030
A duel to settle things.

06:23.150 --> 06:28.080
What is about to begin is
a serious fight between beasts.

06:28.080 --> 06:31.700
Pursena, there's something I've been
wanting to tell you for a while.

06:31.700 --> 06:34.080
The truth is,
I can't stand you at all, meow!

06:34.080 --> 06:35.830
That's my line!

06:35.830 --> 06:41.010
You used to be like my little sister
back when you were a little!

06:41.010 --> 06:42.510
And now you're acting so cocky!

06:42.510 --> 06:45.590
Heh! You're the one who was
the little sister!

06:45.590 --> 06:50.680
Remember that time I covered for you
when you wet the bed at 4 years old?!

06:50.680 --> 06:55.560
You said an Adoldia never forgets a favor
even for a hundred years? Nonsense!

06:55.560 --> 06:59.980
I paid you back when I pulled you
out of the river!

06:59.980 --> 07:03.610
You ungrateful girl, you'll never
find a man in your whole life!

07:03.610 --> 07:06.950
That's because you beat
the suitors away!

07:06.950 --> 07:08.410
Pursena, you doofus!

07:08.410 --> 07:09.700
Linia, you idiot!

07:09.700 --> 07:12.580
Fatty Pursena!

07:14.270 --> 07:17.330
I'm not fat!

07:25.880 --> 07:30.120
Oh my! Pursena charges fiercely forward!
But Linia evades it cleanly!

07:30.120 --> 07:33.720
Pursena got the power,
but Linia's a little faster!

07:33.720 --> 07:36.210
And now an exploding
right straight from Pursena!

07:36.210 --> 07:38.810
Linia is staggering back!
And Pursena won't let her recover!

07:38.810 --> 07:40.230
What now, Linia?

07:40.230 --> 07:42.110
Will you run?
Or will you keep fighting?

07:42.110 --> 07:43.780
She's staying in the fight!

07:43.780 --> 07:45.820
Linia pulls a left jab!
And another jab!

07:45.820 --> 07:47.530
Pursena's taking some hits here!

07:47.530 --> 07:50.490
But Linia is going with her right jab
as Pursena steps forward!

07:50.490 --> 07:54.370
Oh my!
Pursena's uniform is ripped off!

07:54.370 --> 07:56.410
This can't be broadcast!

07:56.410 --> 07:58.850
What do you think, Mr. Zanoba?

08:01.340 --> 08:03.670
Now Pursena is going for it!

08:03.670 --> 08:06.410
Pursena's punch broke
the momentum of Linia's footwork!

08:06.410 --> 08:08.470
She is like a butterfly with
its wings torn off!

08:08.470 --> 08:10.980
Is she going to be trampled down
by the coming champion?!

08:10.980 --> 08:13.060
But then, Linia is back on her feet!

08:13.060 --> 08:15.730
She pushes him back down to the ground!

08:15.730 --> 08:18.020
But Pursena has fangs too!

08:18.020 --> 08:20.310
She bites back!

08:20.310 --> 08:22.360
What a hideous fight.

08:22.360 --> 08:25.110
This is like two brats fighting.

08:25.110 --> 08:27.780
Yes, it definitely seems like that.

08:28.200 --> 08:34.210
Hey, if they're both serious,
why are you making it into a joke?

08:37.080 --> 08:38.650
Sorry.

08:55.970 --> 08:57.560
I won.

09:00.850 --> 09:03.360
It was an awesome sight.

09:03.360 --> 09:05.190
A triumphant sight.

09:05.950 --> 09:08.560
A sight of a winner that just
surpassed her ordeal.

09:15.870 --> 09:18.040
It's my win.

09:18.040 --> 09:20.210
Yeah, congratulations.

09:20.210 --> 09:22.370
I'll heal you up.

09:22.370 --> 09:25.500
Thank you, but there's no need.

09:25.500 --> 09:27.790
These are scars of honor.

09:27.790 --> 09:32.010
I don't know if I'll ever see Linia again,
so I'll keep these scars.

09:33.140 --> 09:36.750
But you're going to be with her
until you leave the city, right?

09:37.430 --> 09:39.350
We're going our separate ways now.

09:39.350 --> 09:42.810
I've already packed my stuff,
so I just have to pick those up and leave.

09:43.810 --> 09:46.730
They must have agreed
on this beforehand.

09:46.730 --> 09:50.320
This is when they go their separate ways,
and where they're parting from each other.

09:52.360 --> 09:54.570
Somehow it's cool.

09:55.160 --> 09:58.990
Make sure to treat the scars,
even if it's not by healing magic.

09:58.990 --> 10:00.660
Yeah, I know.

10:00.660 --> 10:03.330
Boss, goodbye.

10:13.130 --> 10:15.510
They have their own good points.

10:17.100 --> 10:18.150
Now then...

10:22.560 --> 10:23.980
Are you alive?

10:25.330 --> 10:27.020
I am, meow.

10:27.020 --> 10:29.070
Your pretty face is ruined, you know?

10:29.070 --> 10:30.730
That's true, meow.

10:32.900 --> 10:34.780
Thank you.

10:37.680 --> 10:39.330
I lost, meow.

10:39.330 --> 10:41.000
That was a good fight.

10:41.000 --> 10:43.750
I heard all your comments, Boss.

10:43.750 --> 10:46.330
Sounded like you were
enjoying yourself, meow.

10:46.750 --> 10:50.420
Yeah, I failed to read the room there.

10:50.420 --> 10:53.340
But that fight makes me excited.

10:53.340 --> 10:56.970
Oh well, meow.
It's fine if you were enjoying it.

10:56.970 --> 10:59.850
I'm sure it just looked like a brawl
from the sidelines.

10:59.850 --> 11:01.890
Having fun is what life's about.

11:01.890 --> 11:04.640
You don't want me to cast
healing magic on you, too?

11:04.640 --> 11:07.560
To be honest, I want to erase
the scars of my defeat.

11:07.560 --> 11:10.610
I guess I'll make an exception furr these.

11:10.610 --> 11:14.990
Maybe I'll be able to brag
about them in the future.

11:14.990 --> 11:17.160
Scar of honor, is it?

11:17.160 --> 11:19.530
I don't know about beastfolk's fight, but...

11:19.530 --> 11:22.240
That fight completely captured my eyes.

11:22.240 --> 11:25.080
Never thought you'd purraise me.

11:25.080 --> 11:28.250
You look a lot different than when
you two kidnapped us back then.

11:28.710 --> 11:31.250
I'm sorry about the doll
back then, meow.

11:31.250 --> 11:34.760
About that, Master has forgiven you.

11:34.760 --> 11:38.760
I don't have any hostility toward you.

11:44.430 --> 11:47.480
What are you planning to do now?

11:47.480 --> 11:51.020
Maybe I'll travel around for a while,
and then start up a business?

11:51.520 --> 11:54.780
Starting a business?
I got a bad feeling about this.

11:54.780 --> 11:57.660
Do you have a detailed plan
about that?

11:57.660 --> 11:59.410
Of course I do, meow!

11:59.410 --> 12:02.080
Maybe she'd be okay
if she already had a vision?

12:02.740 --> 12:05.660
No, I really got a bad feeling about this.

12:05.660 --> 12:11.170
A feeling that she is going to make
a blunder and get in deep trouble.

12:11.170 --> 12:14.920
In my purran,
I'll be rich in five years.

12:15.370 --> 12:20.140
Well, you can come to me
if you are in trouble, okay?

12:20.140 --> 12:22.240
I'll help you too if you need it.

12:23.100 --> 12:26.520
If I succeed,
I will lend you meowney!

12:29.850 --> 12:33.130
It seems like they don't want
to see each other again.

12:33.670 --> 12:35.900
Even though they were really close.

12:37.400 --> 12:43.450
Still, I couldn't help but admire
their resolve and determination.

12:45.570 --> 12:46.700
- The next day,
- I thought we agreed

12:46.700 --> 12:47.950
- some people saw two beastfolk women
- we'd never see each other again?!

12:47.950 --> 12:49.120
- some people saw two beastfolk women
- You are the one who followed me here!

12:49.120 --> 12:49.570
- covered in bandages arguing in a carriage.
- You are the one who followed me here!

12:49.570 --> 12:51.470
- covered in bandages arguing in a carriage.
- Enough with your spoiled behavior!

12:51.470 --> 12:52.080
- covered in bandages arguing in a carriage.
- You're the one always clinging to me!

12:52.080 --> 12:53.230
- I happened to hear that rumor.
- You're the one always clinging to me!

12:53.230 --> 12:54.250
- I happened to hear that rumor.
- Get off the carriage, meow!

12:54.250 --> 12:55.170
No way!

12:55.170 --> 12:56.170
- I'm sure
- You get off!

12:56.170 --> 12:57.270
- they didn't check the schedule
- Pursena, you get off, meow!

12:57.270 --> 12:58.200
- and ended up in the same carriage.
- No, you get off!

12:58.200 --> 12:59.210
- and ended up in the same carriage.
- No, you!

12:59.210 --> 13:00.050
- and ended up in the same carriage.
- You get off!

13:00.050 --> 13:00.910
- So much for their cool way of parting.
- No, you!

13:00.910 --> 13:01.680
- So much for their cool way of parting.
- You get off!

13:01.680 --> 13:03.010
- So much for their cool way of parting.
- No, you!

13:10.270 --> 13:12.270
All right, let's begin.

13:13.980 --> 13:15.900
Okay, I'll give it the mana.

13:18.610 --> 13:21.530
This thing is really greedy for mana.

13:21.530 --> 13:24.780
I'm not sure anyone other than me
could have used it.

13:24.780 --> 13:26.790
It really takes time.

13:26.790 --> 13:28.000
Maybe we should speed it up?

13:28.000 --> 13:28.830
Shhh.

13:35.000 --> 13:37.130
I have seen these flashes of light before.

13:37.840 --> 13:42.090
These are the lights right before
the Teleport Incident.

13:42.550 --> 13:44.680
Should I stop now?

13:44.680 --> 13:46.970
If it causes the teleportation,
everyone here will...

13:47.970 --> 13:49.220
No.

13:49.220 --> 13:52.980
We've done all the experiments
to make sure that won't happen.

13:53.600 --> 13:56.400
Everything is going to be okay!
This is going to work!

14:12.000 --> 14:13.170
It worked.

14:14.210 --> 14:16.590
Yes!

14:16.590 --> 14:18.840
Congratulations, Master!

14:18.840 --> 14:19.920
Well done!

14:19.920 --> 14:22.720
I must say, this looks ominous.

14:22.720 --> 14:24.590
Would it be okay to hold this thing?

14:24.590 --> 14:28.930
Sure, but don't drop it.
It's actually easy to break.

14:28.930 --> 14:33.440
Nanahoshi, that watermelon
belongs to that world, right?

14:33.440 --> 14:35.440
Since that doesn't exist in this world.

14:35.440 --> 14:36.690
Maybe.

14:36.690 --> 14:40.610
We still can't choose what we summon.

14:40.610 --> 14:43.700
I was actually trying to summon
a cabbage this time.

14:43.700 --> 14:45.710
- It's surprisingly filling and heavy.
- This world does have

14:45.710 --> 14:47.620
- That's because most of it is water.
- a vegetable similar to cabbage.

14:47.620 --> 14:49.620
- It's sweet and delicious, you know.
- But the question is, can we tell them apart?

14:49.620 --> 14:51.580
- Even with an ominous look?
- But the question is, can we tell them apart?

14:51.580 --> 14:52.240
- Now that you mention it,
- Maybe summoning a vegetable had been

14:52.240 --> 14:54.240
- it doesn't look that appetizing.
- Maybe summoning a vegetable had been

14:54.240 --> 14:55.950
- But that's just the skin.
- a flawed experiment from the start.

14:55.950 --> 14:57.580
- The inside is actually just like fruit.
- a flawed experiment from the start.

14:57.580 --> 15:00.460
I'll open that for you all later,
so look forward to it.

15:00.960 --> 15:02.840
No, it's fine.

15:02.840 --> 15:06.010
We summoned a watermelon
even though we wanted vegetables.

15:06.010 --> 15:08.220
We can call this a success.

15:08.220 --> 15:11.890
Okay, given that this is a success,
let's celebrate tonight.

15:11.890 --> 15:13.600
Yeah, sounds good.

15:14.090 --> 15:15.850
Cheers!

15:16.440 --> 15:18.610
It had become a tradition
to throw a party

15:18.610 --> 15:22.230
whenever someone has
something to celebrate.

15:22.590 --> 15:25.610
But there's no more Linia and Pursena.

15:25.610 --> 15:28.620
Instead, Roxy and Norn joined in.

15:28.620 --> 15:32.870
Badigadi isn't here anymore, either.
The parties had gotten a bit less lively.

15:32.870 --> 15:36.250
However, that couldn't stop us
from enjoying ourselves.

15:36.250 --> 15:40.170
That said, it's my first time seeing
Nanahoshi that cheerful.

15:40.170 --> 15:42.300
Here is your filling, Rudy.

15:42.300 --> 15:45.380
Thank you.
Are you not drinking tonight?

15:45.380 --> 15:48.800
I become weird if I drink, you know?

15:48.800 --> 15:50.640
I was thinking of stopping drinking.

15:50.640 --> 15:52.220
I see.

15:52.220 --> 15:54.350
We're not staying out tonight, okay?

15:54.350 --> 15:57.440
I want to put Lucy to bed, you hear?

15:57.440 --> 15:58.650
I understand.

15:58.650 --> 16:02.020
It's a shame. Sylphie was really cute
when she got drunk.

16:02.020 --> 16:06.150
Rudy, please move the chair a little.

16:09.070 --> 16:11.070
Roxy, are you drunk?

16:11.070 --> 16:12.390
Just a bit.

16:12.390 --> 16:14.660
Do that to me later too, okay?

16:14.660 --> 16:16.120
Of course, ma'am.

16:16.120 --> 16:21.460
In fact, I want Sylphie to sit on
my right leg and Roxy on my left.

16:21.460 --> 16:22.710
Brother.

16:24.380 --> 16:27.630
Sorry, Norn.
Must be embarrassing for you.

16:27.630 --> 16:29.260
No, I'm fine.

16:29.710 --> 16:34.010
Actually, I want to discuss something.
Is that okay?

16:34.010 --> 16:35.890
Sure, what is it?

16:35.890 --> 16:40.400
It's about the Student Council.

16:40.830 --> 16:42.190
About that, huh?

16:42.190 --> 16:47.110
Right, I saw Norn with the Student Council
during the graduation ceremony.

16:47.520 --> 16:49.990
Senior Ariel invited me to join.

16:50.740 --> 16:53.990
She knows my grades
aren't that good,

16:53.990 --> 16:58.620
but she said I have natural charisma,
so she wanted me to join.

16:58.620 --> 16:59.960
I see.

16:59.960 --> 17:03.750
Indeed, Norn has a lot of fans
in this University.

17:03.750 --> 17:05.800
Did you know, Sylphie?

17:05.800 --> 17:07.510
Yes.

17:07.510 --> 17:09.420
So she already knew.

17:09.420 --> 17:11.390
Don't tell me, Roxy too?

17:13.140 --> 17:16.599
I was the only one who didn't know.

17:16.599 --> 17:20.599
Sorry, Norn said she wanted
to tell you herself.

17:20.599 --> 17:21.690
Is that so?

17:22.310 --> 17:24.020
Uh, Brother...

17:24.020 --> 17:27.359
Would it be okay if I joined
the Student Council officially?

17:27.359 --> 17:28.610
Of course...

17:28.610 --> 17:33.200
Wait, Norn has sword training with me
and is also writing a storybook.

17:33.200 --> 17:37.080
Can she keep it up if she adds
Student Council's work to her schedule?

17:37.790 --> 17:38.870
Norn.

17:38.870 --> 17:39.710
Yes?

17:39.710 --> 17:43.000
I'm not against you joining
the Student Council.

17:43.000 --> 17:45.210
I'm asking you,
can you manage all your tasks?

17:45.710 --> 17:49.510
I'm sure the lessons will be
tougher as a third-year.

17:49.510 --> 17:53.720
I'm going to do my best with
the book, training, and the lessons.

17:54.180 --> 17:57.470
Talking is easy, but...

17:58.930 --> 18:00.100
Rudy.

18:01.240 --> 18:04.600
Norn is doing well so far.

18:04.600 --> 18:08.440
She has been helping
the Student Council for a year now.

18:08.440 --> 18:13.780
Huh? So she has been doing it since
we started the sword training, then?

18:14.410 --> 18:17.780
She's going to be okay.
I'll vouch for her.

18:18.620 --> 18:23.540
I see. She's already doing that,
so that's why she's asking.

18:23.540 --> 18:26.290
Then, there's no reason to oppose it.

18:26.750 --> 18:28.800
It seems you've been working hard.

18:29.300 --> 18:33.630
I don't think you needed my permission
in the first place, but I allow it.

18:34.720 --> 18:36.300
Thank you so much!

18:37.760 --> 18:39.720
Attention please!

18:39.720 --> 18:41.810
Let's split the watermelon!

18:41.810 --> 18:45.060
In the end, it was up to her effort.

18:45.600 --> 18:49.820
Even Nanahoshi could produce this result
because she's been working hard.

18:49.820 --> 18:51.820
It's the same with Linia and Pursena.

18:52.240 --> 18:56.700
However, the people around them have
the duty to support and cheer them on.

18:57.190 --> 19:01.580
Even I can be here because I have
the support from everyone around me.

19:02.030 --> 19:05.540
So I'll support them as much
as I can, too.

19:10.500 --> 19:12.170
Good work for today.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.340
Are you okay?

19:15.220 --> 19:17.510
Want me to cast Detoxification?

19:17.510 --> 19:20.970
Sylphie did that a while ago.
I think it's still okay.

19:21.400 --> 19:23.850
Anyway, you helped me again.

19:23.850 --> 19:26.230
Now we can move on to the next phase.

19:26.690 --> 19:31.230
Phase four is to summon a living thing
that meets the criteria, right?

19:31.230 --> 19:32.190
That's right.

19:32.190 --> 19:35.610
And I'm planning to ask someone
who's very knowledgeable about this.

19:35.610 --> 19:39.120
The one who has authority on
summoning she mentioned before?

19:40.950 --> 19:44.080
It's not Orsted, is it?

19:44.080 --> 19:45.710
Of course not.

19:46.960 --> 19:49.880
On that note,
I have a proposal for you.

19:49.880 --> 19:52.610
I haven't given you a reward for
the experiment before, right?

19:52.610 --> 19:56.170
Oh, back then I was very busy
and couldn't go to meet you.

19:56.170 --> 20:02.100
I was thinking of introducing him to you
as a combined reward for both phases.

20:02.100 --> 20:03.890
Introducing him to me?

20:03.890 --> 20:07.850
But if you count this as two rewards,
is this guy really that incredible?

20:07.850 --> 20:14.630
Yes, and he might be able to do something
about your mother's memory loss.

20:15.570 --> 20:17.110
W-What?

20:17.530 --> 20:20.120
Is that true?

20:20.520 --> 20:21.950
Though I can't say for sure.

20:21.950 --> 20:25.370
He's been alive for a very long time,
so there's a good chance.

20:27.270 --> 20:30.460
Zenith is recovering well by now.

20:30.460 --> 20:34.030
Still, it is hard to tell if her memories
are ever going to return or not.

20:34.460 --> 20:36.210
Even if he can't heal her,

20:36.210 --> 20:39.220
he might know about
something similar to her case.

20:39.220 --> 20:41.470
That itself is worth trying.

20:42.180 --> 20:46.890
I'm sure you have your reason
why you couldn't tell me this sooner.

20:46.890 --> 20:50.350
Yes. I'm sorry, but I have
my own circumstances, too.

20:50.810 --> 20:53.860
Is this about Nanahoshi's master?

20:53.860 --> 20:58.240
If you're going to introduce him,
I'd also like to meet him.

20:58.240 --> 21:02.660
Well, you two did help too.
I suppose it's okay.

21:02.660 --> 21:05.950
Excuse me, I'm a bit interested.

21:05.950 --> 21:09.370
Is it okay to go with this many people?
Won't we be a nuisance?

21:09.370 --> 21:11.000
Don't worry about that.

21:11.000 --> 21:13.710
He said he can accommodate
up to twelve guests.

21:13.710 --> 21:16.840
But it's going to take time
to meet him, right?

21:16.840 --> 21:19.220
Not really, it won't take a day.

21:19.220 --> 21:21.510
Huh? He's your neighbor?

21:21.510 --> 21:24.010
Do you meet him sometimes?

21:24.010 --> 21:28.560
He's not, and I haven't seen him
in some time, but there's a way.

21:28.560 --> 21:30.100
Is that so?

21:30.440 --> 21:33.050
Then, what's his name?

21:38.240 --> 21:41.610
I'd like you all to keep this a secret,
is that okay?

21:45.370 --> 21:47.490
Perugius, the Armored Dragon King.

21:49.760 --> 21:51.750
Perugius, the Armored Dragon King.

21:52.170 --> 21:58.380
One of the three Demon Godslayers,
the hero who guided humanity to victory

21:58.380 --> 22:01.340
in the Laplace War 400 years ago.

22:02.010 --> 22:05.010
EPISODE 7
PHASE FOUR

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
NEXT EPISODE
FLOATING FORTRESS
